  "title": "CHAPTER 17: SCIENTIFIC NAMES OF IMPORTANT PLANTS & ANIMALS",
  "order": 18,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "8n9sa1g",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Introduction to Scientific Names (Binomial Nomenclature)"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Focuses on scientific names categorized through Binomial Nomenclature.",
        "Covers key plant divisions including food crops, fruits, vegetables, cereals, pulses, and plantation crops.",
        "Details fauna categories including domestic animals, wild animals, birds, reptiles, and aquatic species.",
        "Includes biological classification of important microorganisms and quick revision points."
      ],
      "id": "22igvik"
    },
    {
      "type": "statStrip",
      "stats": [
